## FAQ

**When do I get my reward?**
As soon as your friend completes their first purchase (minimum $50).

**Is there a limit?**
No limit — refer as many friends as you want.

**What if my friend already has an account?**
The referral only applies to new accounts. Each email can only be referred once.
